    "type": "metaphor",
    "difficulty": "hard",
    "context": "情绪被点亮"
  },
  {
    "id": "metaphor_008",
    "text": "这次成功像一块落地的石头，让人安心。",
    "label": "positive",
    "type": "metaphor",
    "difficulty": "hard",
    "context": "成功带来安定"
  },
  {
    "id": "metaphor_009",
    "text": "他的建议像一阵暖风，吹散了我的焦虑。",
    "label": "positive",
    "type": "metaphor",
    "difficulty": "hard",
    "context": "缓解压力"
  },
  {
    "id": "metaphor_010",
    "text": "他的回复像冬天的铁门。",
    "label": "negative",
    "type": "metaphor",
    "difficulty": "hard",
    "context": "回复冷淡"
  },
  {
    "id": "metaphor_011",
    "text": "那句话像一把慢慢合上的刀。",
